*Dandy's full name is Dandicus Dancifer, according to one of the loading screens, an interaction between {{CI|Teagan|name=true}} and {{CI|Pebble|name=true}}, a few of {{CI|Dyle|name=true}}'s [[Gossip]] and an in-game ad for [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/18266863515/Dandys-Petals Dandy's Petals].
